'''Contra Costa''' ({{Literal translation|opposite coast|counter coast}}; {{Langx|gug|Yvytyra-Tatá-Yasí|4=hill of the bright northern star}}) is a borough of the [[Castejón|Castejón Metropolis]], within the [[Concordia|Concordia conurbation]]. The borough's name refers to its position on the other side of the bay from the historic urban core of Castejón.  

The borough is the sixth most populous in the metropolis; with a recorded population of 2,235,642 residents in the [[2025 Baliscan census]]. 

